<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  Three energy stocks cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  Three energy stocks cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Fred Leuffer Jr. lowered his recommendation on Exxon Corp and Amoco Corp to neutral from attractive and cut Kerr-McGee Corp to neutral from buy, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- The downgrades were made on the basis of valuation, the source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Exxon shares were unchanged at 103-3/8, Amoco slipped 1/2 to 84-1/4 and Kerr-McGee lost 1/4 to 73-1/8.</p>
</text>
